OL,3,CMore doubt cast over Tyson Fury and
OL,4,CAnthony Joshua showdown
OL,6,FTyson Fury and promoter Dana White
OL,7,Fhave cast further doubt on the
OL,8,Fblockbuster heavyweight clash with
OL,9,FAnthony Joshua.
OL,11,FIt was announced on Friday, 25
OL,12,FSeptember, that a deal had finally
OL,13,Fbeen reached for the two biggest
OL,14,FBritish fighters of the era to meet in
OL,15,Fthe ring in Cardiff on 11 December.
OL,17,FBut no sooner had a date been set than
OL,18,Fthe long-awaited fight ran into
OL,19,Ftrouble, with Joshua's promoter Eddie
OL,20,FHearn disputing the involvement of
OL,21,FAmerican White.
