OL,3,CMore doubt cast over Tyson Fury and
OL,4,CAnthony Joshua showdown
OL,6,FThe boss of UFC and Zuffa Boxing was
OL,7,Fofficially named as a promoter
OL,8,Falongside The Ring, which is owned by
OL,9,FSaudi Arabian powerbroker Turki
OL,10,FAlalshikh.
OL,12,FFury claimed that Hearn and Joshua
OL,13,Fwere trying to pull out and, speaking
OL,14,Fon his YouTube channel, Fury put the
OL,15,Fchances of a fight going ahead at one
OL,16,Fper cent.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
