OL,3,CMore doubt cast over Tyson Fury and
OL,4,CAnthony Joshua showdown
OL,6,FHe said: "If you've got a guy that
OL,7,Fwants to fight, and you've got a guy
OL,8,Fthat doesn't want to fight, then how
OL,9,Fare you going to make that fight
OL,10,Fhappen?"
OL,12,FSpeaking after Johnny Fisher's victory
OL,13,Fat the Copper Box on Saturday, 26
OL,14,FSeptember, White refused to back down.
OL,16,F"I'm involved in the fight," he said.
OL,17,F"If Eddie Hearn really cared about
OL,18,Fthis fight, first of all it would have
OL,19,Fhappened a long time ago, number one.
OL,20,FNumber two, he could finance the thing
OL,21,Fhimself.
